<overview>
<p>The Free Worlds League Military has long fielded some of the largest infantry formations in the Inner Sphere, with regiments numbering nearly 1,800 soldiers compared to roughly 750 in the Combine and just over 1,000 in the Federated Suns. Towing crew-served LB 5-X autocannon, these platoons field versatile weapons capable of firing solid slugs for armor penetration or cluster rounds for area effect against dispersed targets.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on common production date of LBX autocannon
